WEBVTT

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:12.200
"5 years ago"

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:14.910
The greatest authority of Black Sorcery
in the land, the Tower of Fangs.

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:21.120
Everyone knew it was the training ground
for the most powerful Black Sorcerers.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:31.790
Despite all their talent, Azalie Cait-Sith
was considered a prodigy among them.

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:33.500
She was called the Chaos Witch

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.580
and Krylancelo was
very proud to call her his sister.

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:47.540
Ow...

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:51.790
Apparently you're always just waiting
for me to throw you around.

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:27.950
"The Chaos Witch and
the Successor of the Razor's Edge"

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:32.450
You'll never be able to win in
a real fight like that, Krylancelo.

00:02:32.450 --> 00:02:35.120
I-I just let you win.

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:38.160
If I didn't, you'd be in a bad mood all day.

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:40.040
Oh, really?

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:44.000
Then wanna go another round right here?

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:45.660
Don't you dare.

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:47.370
Oh. Hey, Tish.

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:49.790
I'm warning you as a prefect.

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:52.620
If any of you cause any problems
while Master Childman is away,

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:54.410
you'll be whipped 100 times!

00:02:54.410 --> 00:02:56.250
Is that clear, Azalie?

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:59.950
You sure don't hold back even
though I'm your cousin, Leticia.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:03.830
Huh? There's no one here. Where's Master?

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:06.910
Master went with Corgon
to investigate some ruins.

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:07.950
And where's Forte?

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:09.870
Forte's in the library.

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:12.790
Honestly. I wish he'd take more
responsibility as the class monitor.

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:14.620
And where's everyone else?

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:17.700
Heartia and Comicron are both late.

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:20.580
This happens all the time
as soon as Master's gone.

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:22.870
Those troublemakers never learn.

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:25.790
You're the biggest troublemaker of them all!

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:27.700
Don't you dare cause any more problems.

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:30.000
Yeah, yeah, okay. Jeez.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.910
I just need to behave, right?

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:35.450
Hey, where are you going? Azalie!

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:40.410
She never learns. She's such a headache.

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:44.750
I know, right? She's always been like this.

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:46.450
That goes for you, too!

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:49.370
Cause me any more trouble and you'll regret it!

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:51.200
O-Okay, already...

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:54.620
I'm going to patrol the tower.

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:58.370
As if you're not always fighting with Azalie yourself.

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:00.000
Krylancelo, listen to this!

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.950
I totally met this girl from another class and--

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:04.500
Heartia.

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:06.540
Let me give you a warning, as well.

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:10.040
I forbid you from approaching
another girl in this school from now on.

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:11.750
What?! W-Wait, why?!

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:14.540
If you come within five meters of them,

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:17.580
you'll be hung upside down
for ten minutes every time!

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:18.950
Is that clear?

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:21.370
Tish... You're so heartless...

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:25.750
That's because you're always trying
to talk to every girl you come across.

00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:27.950
Well, I keep falling for them
so what am I supposed to do?!

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:30.250
We're in deep trouble!

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:33.700
Help me, you commoners!

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:40.080
Stop running in the hallways.

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:44.040
Ah, it feels wonderful when you do a great deed.

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:47.120
You alive, Comicron?

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:50.040
What happened now?

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:52.620
You two need to come with me immediately!

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:55.120
Behold the glory of my latest creation!

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:04.450
H-Halt!

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:19.450
Is that one of your androids, Comicron?

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:21.200
This is a huge disaster!

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:23.410
Hurry up and stop them!

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:24.540
I cannot.

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:26.660
What do you mean you can't?!

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:33.040
My prototype mechanical battle soldier version 2
just suddenly started moving on its own!

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:35.200
Huh?

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:39.830
Was it a ghost?!

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:44.410
I have no idea! But we have to stop it somehow!

00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:50.040
All right. I'll take care of it.

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:51.910
O Wind!

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:08.660
At this rate, it's going to destroy the school!

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:11.620
Embrace my surroundings, Dancing Bronco!

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:19.200
Hark, O Light!

00:06:25.540 --> 00:06:26.950
Tish?!

00:06:27.910 --> 00:06:29.620
What in the world is going on?!

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:31.660
You have some explaining to do!

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:35.410
That was amazing, Krylancelo!

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:38.950
You stopped my android in an instant!

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:41.620
You live up to your name,
the Successor of the Razor's Edge.

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:44.200
You're exaggerating, Comicron.

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:50.040
The Successor of the Razor's Edge, eh?

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:57.870
Wake up!

00:06:57.870 --> 00:07:00.540
Krylancelo!

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:01.830
Ow...

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:04.330
Come on, we're leaving.

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:05.950
What?

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:14.950
Leaving? Where are we going?

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:16.620
You'll see.

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:36.750
Raindust...

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:38.580
That's right! Today's...

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:40.790
You finally remember?

00:07:40.790 --> 00:07:43.040
Yeah, today's...

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:46.120
...the one day a year we go visit their graves.

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:49.200
Sure looks rundown.

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:52.040
Yeah, it's uninhabitable now.

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:56.370
I mean, there's nothing they could've done
after this place got taken over by some bandits.

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:07.700
That orphanage doesn't look familiar at all anymore.

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:09.700
Yeah...

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:14.910
Back then, that place was my palace.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:27.290
Seven, eight, nine, ten!

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:43.120
The day you came to the orphanage was
a really cold winter's day just like today.

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:48.910
You were still a baby

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:51.290
all wrapped up in a pink blanket

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:53.910
and crying so hard your face was red.

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:56.910
Wow, what a pretty pink color!

00:08:56.910 --> 00:08:59.620
Tish! Tish! A new baby's here!

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:02.410
Hurry! Come over here and look!

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:06.040
I think Tish was out back helping with the laundry

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:09.540
and had no idea that you'd arrived.

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:15.910
They made a huge fuss out of you.
I mean, us Sorcerer kids are special.

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:18.290
Did you really have to say that yourself?

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:22.830
But I'm surprised you remember
something from so long ago.

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:29.000
I don't actually remember much else,
but I remember that as clear as day.

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.160
But I mean, how could I forget it?

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:34.370
It's the day I first met my cute little brother.

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:39.200
Then do you remember the day that
you and Tish were taken in by the Tower?

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:41.910
I actually don't remember that very well.

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:43.080
Do you remember?

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:44.330
Huh?

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:04.540
Wait! Azalie! Tish!

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:09.620
Yeah, I'm not sure...

00:10:09.620 --> 00:10:12.580
What the heck? So you don't remember.

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:27.200
Next year will be Tish's turn.

00:10:38.870 --> 00:10:40.450
Azalie?

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:42.040
Azalie!

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:45.660
Azalie?

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:10.000
Azalie!

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:38.790
Honestly... Why does Azalie always
have to cause me so much trouble?

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:42.200
Knowing Azalie, she might've gotten tired,

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:45.870
and then gone into someone's
house to sleep on their bed.

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:05.160
Krylancelo...

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:07.370
Who's there?!

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:11.950
I have your sister.

00:12:11.950 --> 00:12:16.450
If you want her back, go to the orphanage.

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:20.540
You're demanding things when
you haven't even said who you are?

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:23.950
You should probably hurry.

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:28.450
If you dare do anything to Azalie,
I'll make sure you regret it!

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:39.500
It's really quiet.
So are they planning a surprise attack?

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:49.410
This is my only weapon.

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:53.450
I can't do anything until I confirm Azalie's safety.

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:58.040
The only thing I can do right now is--

00:13:03.290 --> 00:13:04.950
My knife!

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:20.160
Guide my path, Deathsong Starling!

00:13:56.910 --> 00:13:59.200
Where the heck is she?

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:07.290
I need to hurry up and find Azalie.

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:18.200
Azalie...

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:22.660
So you made it this far.

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:27.450
Where's Azalie?

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:29.830
Where are you, Azalie?!

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:33.120
Her head... Was that an illusion?

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:39.830
What you saw was the truth.

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:43.700
What I saw?

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:50.080
Then... That was Azalie's...

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:52.790
How dare you do that to Azalie?!

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:01.040
H-How...?

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:04.830
How are you attacking me without moving?

00:15:08.250 --> 00:15:12.000
Apparently you're all talk. How pathetic.

00:15:12.870 --> 00:15:15.580
Is that just a mental projection?

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:18.040
In that case...

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:21.540
I'm getting in my own way of attacking her.

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:24.660
At this rate, you'll never... No.

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:29.120
This is why you weren't able to protect your sister.

00:15:29.120 --> 00:15:32.700
I don't know how much this building
will be able to take, but...

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:36.000
Hey, are you even listening to me?

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:39.910
I'm going to close off my mind
and make myself disappear!

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:43.000
H-Hey! Wait a second!

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:44.410
I crush thee...

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:45.200
Huh?!

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:48.040
Primordial Silence!

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:11.700
He actually beat me... I couldn't defeat him.

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:20.910
It's all my fault.

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:23.830
It's all my fault that Azalie...

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:27.870
Krylancelo.

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:32.200
Huh? A-Azalie?!

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:36.250
Wait. But you... What's going on?

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:38.750
Come on. Let's head home.

00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:40.620
What?!

00:16:54.250 --> 00:16:58.250
I see. So that's what happened.

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:00.660
How could you be so cruel?!

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:01.910
You tricked me!

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:03.000
What are you talking about?

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:04.160
Don't play dumb!

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:08.790
You're the one who told me it was
dangerous to mentally project yourself!

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:10.500
Did something happen?!

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:15.580
You're all torn up. I guess someone
must've been messing with you.

00:17:15.580 --> 00:17:21.580
Did I ever tell you that my ancestors
have a habit of haunting this area at night?

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:26.000
Oh, I see. I guess your stupid
family must've been really good

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:28.660
at wasting their powers doing stupid things then.

00:17:28.660 --> 00:17:33.700
Come to think of it... Are you the one
that made Comicron's machine move?

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:35.250
It was you, wasn't it?!

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:37.700
Oh? What could you be talking about?

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:41.910
You were using White Sorcery
to mentally project yourself!

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:44.540
Your jokes seriously go too far sometimes!

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:50.450
Oh, I found this lying on the ground, too.

00:17:50.450 --> 00:17:56.080
Oh, really? How interesting that it was
you that coincidentally found my knife.

00:17:57.330 --> 00:18:00.500
I really have no idea why you find all this so fun,

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:06.080
but maybe you should stop playing dumb
and apologize every once in a while.

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:08.790
Do you have any idea how worried--

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:08.790
Thank you.

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:10.500
Huh?

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:15.040
Thank you for worrying about me.

00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:20.830
That's not what I meant!

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:21.870
You need to apologize properly!

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:23.620
Come on. Let's go home.

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:26.620
If we don't hurry, we're going
to have to spend the night outside!

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:28.450
And whose fault is that?!

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:31.290
Ugh! You're always like this, Azalie!

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:33.250
You always change the subject when you're in trouble!

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:34.250
Okay, okay.

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:36.120
Don't brush me off like that!

00:18:36.120 --> 00:18:40.040
Say, if something like this ever happens again...

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:42.870
What?! You're planning to do this again?!

00:18:42.870 --> 00:18:44.580
That's not what I meant.

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:50.290
Make sure you actually find me next time.

00:18:50.290 --> 00:18:51.870
Got it?

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:11.450
Why didn't you try to kill me?

00:19:11.450 --> 00:19:13.790
Because he didn't want me to.

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:16.450
You're lying. He was...

00:19:16.450 --> 00:19:18.910
Childman was trying to kill me!

00:19:18.910 --> 00:19:23.540
You're wrong. Why do you think
he personally went after you?

00:19:23.540 --> 00:19:27.160
So that he could return to normal.

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:31.950
Why did he allow you to switch
bodies with him without resisting?

00:19:31.950 --> 00:19:34.290
He should've been able to stop you.

00:19:34.290 --> 00:19:36.910
He wanted to save you...

00:19:36.910 --> 00:19:40.160
...with his own hands.

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:43.830
No... That can't be true.

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:52.160
I wanted to be a woman worthy of him.

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:56.000
I'm going... to get my time back.

00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:01.330
Ow!

00:20:01.330 --> 00:20:03.580
Shh! He'll hear you!

00:20:03.580 --> 00:20:05.870
How long do you plan on hiding?

00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:08.250
How long did you know we were here?

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:09.540
From the beginning.

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:10.950
Huh?

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:18.410
Ever since you offered me this nice carriage
outta town since I fixed up your mansion for you.

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:20.330
Impressive!

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:21.830
Very!

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:24.120
Even if I tried to drag you off this carriage,

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:25.750
you'd just find another way back on.

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:27.410
Yup!

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:29.660
Honestly, you two...

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:32.700
Well, you told me you'd teach me Sorcery!

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:35.500
And yet, you left without even stopping by the inn.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:37.450
That's so mean!

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:39.540
We're not going to play somewhere.

00:20:39.540 --> 00:20:41.950
Well, I already discussed this with my dad!

00:20:41.950 --> 00:20:45.120
Me, too! I made sure
to leave my mother a letter.

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:49.700
Wait. Why did you even
come along in the first place?

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:51.870
I want to see the world!

00:20:51.870 --> 00:20:55.160
I want to go to all kinds of places,
meet all kinds of people,

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:58.290
and learn all the things!

00:20:58.290 --> 00:21:02.290
And I'll be safe since
I'm with such a powerful Sorcerer.

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:03.830
I guess it's settled then.

00:21:03.830 --> 00:21:07.410
I never said you two could come with me.

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:09.000
I'll pay you a monthly fee!

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:10.620
Leave the cooking to me!

00:21:10.620 --> 00:21:12.410
I may not look it, but I'm an excellent cook.

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:15.250
Wow. You actually cook, Claiomh?

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:17.950
Wait, you two know each other?

00:21:17.950 --> 00:21:19.370
Didn't I tell you?

00:21:19.370 --> 00:21:22.330
Though we're not the same age,
Majic's in the same class as me

00:21:22.330 --> 00:21:25.410
and we're both buddies in the War Club.

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:27.000
Right, Majic?

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:30.750
She's always ordering me around
since I'm three years younger than her.

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:33.290
Could you not make me sound like a bad person?!

00:21:33.290 --> 00:21:36.500
Let's see, that way is north...

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:39.250
So this must be our current location.

00:21:39.250 --> 00:21:42.700
Hey, where are we headed anyway?

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:44.500
Tafrem.

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:46.290
Tafrem...

00:21:49.500 --> 00:21:52.160
That's where the Tower of Fangs is.

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:58.330
Yeah. We're going through Fenrir's Forest.

00:23:37.870 --> 00:23:40.160
I can't wait to be a Sorcerer, too!

00:23:40.160 --> 00:23:42.370
Sorcerers have plenty of enemies.

00:23:42.370 --> 00:23:44.500
The royal family, the Kimluck Church,

00:23:44.500 --> 00:23:46.950
not to mention, this race that lives in the forest.

00:23:44.950 --> 00:23:46.950
"Deep Dragon"
